@startuml LMS_Arch_01_MVC
title Architecture 1: Model-View-Controller (MVC)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Student / Librarian\n(Web Browser)" as Browser #E3F2FD

rectangle "CONTROLLER\n(Django Views & URL Handlers)" as Controller #FFF9C4 {
  note as N_Ctrl
    • Request Parsing
    • Circulation Logic
    • Input Validation
    • Role-based Limits
  end note
}

rectangle "VIEW\n(Django Templates & Bootstrap UI)" as View #E8F5E9 {
  note as N_View
    • Dynamic HTML Rendering
    • Catalog Search & Autocomplete
    • Availability Display
    • Queue Position Display
  end note
}

database "MODEL\n(Django ORM & PostgreSQL)" as Model #FCE4EC {
  note as N_Model
    • BorrowingRules
    • BookTitle & BookCopy
    • Patron
    • BorrowTransaction
    • Reservation
  end note
}

Browser --> Controller : 1: HTTP Request
View --> Browser : 7: HTML / JSON Response

Controller --> View : 2: Render Context
View --> Controller : 3: User Events / Form Submit

Controller --> Model : 4: Update (Atomic Transaction)
View --> Model : 5: Refresh / Query
Model --> View : 6: Query Results

@enduml
